WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.150
The four cards show alternative responses, not a sequence you must follow.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.300
Start with the specific action and its actual delegation. Act within permission

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:15.450
and conditions; otherwise seek approval, refer or decline and escalate.

00:00:15.667 --> 00:00:20.098
Key takeaway Choose act, seek approval, refer, or decline and escalate according

00:00:20.098 --> 00:00:24.529
to the exact action and its conditions. The fictional USD 2,000 ordering

00:00:24.529 --> 00:00:28.960
limit is conditional; it is not payment authority and cannot be bypassed

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:33.392
by splitting purchases.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:38.150
The two privacy cards emphasise the minimum information necessary and the approved

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:42.700
recipient. Decline an unauthorised request for the full private diary, and explain

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:47.250
the boundary through the approved route.
